      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FOLSOMPRISONHOOVES (8) has the right recent profile for a race like this, with three placings from five starts and a Wagga fourth last time when beaten two and a half lengths by Masakari. The weight relief is a useful offset to the quick back-up, as is the drop in trip. Will take some catching. WEEKDAY FLYER (7) resumes with upside after a Kembla Grange trial and had shown enough in her first campaign. Blinkers come off for her return and she drops back to country level now. Can make an impression. MISS BINMAN (5) was just fair last start but can improve under this scenario. AQUILINO (1) is hard fit and knocking on the door after a close second at this track. Has to be included on the back of that performance.",
